{"seq":1,"slug":"webgpu-overview","title":"WebGPU 概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/webgpu-intro/webgpu-overview","wordCount":732,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"webgpu-概览\">WebGPU 概览</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WebGPU 是下一代 Web 图形和计算 API，旨在替代 WebGL 成为浏览器中 GPU 编程的标准接口。它的设计借鉴了 Vulkan、Metal 和 Direct3D 12 等现代图形 API 的理念，提供了比 WebGL 更低级别的 GPU 控制、更好的性能和更强大的计算能力。WebGPU 不仅用于图形渲染，还原生支持通用 GPU 计算（GPGPU），为机器学习推理、物理模拟等计算密集型任务打开了浏览器端的大门。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[WebGPU API] --&gt; B[图形渲染管线]&#10;    A --&gt; C[计算管线]&#10;    B --&gt; D[顶点着色器]&#10;    B --&gt; E[片元着色器]&#10;    C --&gt; F[计算着色器]&#10;    D --&gt; G[GPU 硬件]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    A --&gt; H[资源管理]&#10;    H --&gt; I[Buffer 缓冲区]&#10;    H --&gt; J[Texture 纹理]&#10;    H --&gt; K[Sampler 采样器]\">graph TD\n    A[WebGPU API] --&gt; B[图形渲染管线]\n    A --&gt; C[计算管线]\n    B --&gt; D[顶点着色器]\n    B --&gt; E[片元着色器]\n    C --&gt; F[计算着色器]\n    D --&gt; G[GPU 硬件]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    A --&gt; H[资源管理]\n    H --&gt; I[Buffer 缓冲区]\n    H --&gt; J[Texture 纹理]\n    H --&gt; K[Sampler 采样器]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>WebGL 1.0</th>\n<th>WebGL 2.0</th>\n<th>WebGPU</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础标准</td>\n<td>OpenGL ES 2.0</td>\n<td>OpenGL ES 3.0</td>\n<td>Vulkan/Metal/D3D12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>着色器语言</td>\n<td>GLSL ES</td>\n<td>GLSL ES 3.0</td>\n<td>WGSL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算着色器</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>部分（扩展）</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多线程渲染</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态管理</td>\n<td>全局状态机</td>\n<td>全局状态机</td>\n<td>管线状态对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>同步查询</td>\n<td>同步查询</td>\n<td>异步验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存控制</td>\n<td>隐式</td>\n<td>隐式</td>\n<td>显式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器支持</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>广泛</td>\n<td>Chrome/Edge/Firefox(实验)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>WebGPU 的核心设计原则是<strong>显式控制</strong>——开发者明确管理资源的创建、绑定和销毁，GPU 状态通过不可变的管线对象描述，而非 WebGL 中的全局状态机。这种设计消除了驱动层的猜测和优化开销，让性能更加可预测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心架构与对象模型\">核心架构与对象模型</h2><p>WebGPU 的对象模型以 Device 为中心，所有 GPU 资源和操作都通过 Device 创建。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const initWebGPU = async (canvas: HTMLCanvasElement) =&gt; {&#10;  const adapter = await navigator.gpu.requestAdapter({&#10;    powerPreference: &#39;high-performance&#39;,&#10;  });&#10;  if (!adapter) throw new Error(&#39;WebGPU adapter not available&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const device = await adapter.requestDevice({&#10;    requiredFeatures: [],&#10;    requiredLimits: {&#10;      maxBindGroups: 4,&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const context = canvas.getContext(&#39;webgpu&#39;);&#10;  if (!context) throw new Error(&#39;WebGPU context not available&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const format = navigator.gpu.getPreferredCanvasFormat();&#10;  context.configure({&#10;    device,&#10;    format,&#10;    alphaMode: &#39;premultiplied&#39;,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return { adapter, device, context, format };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> initWebGPU</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">canvas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLCanvasElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> adapter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.gpu.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">requestAdapter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    powerPreference: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'high-performance'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">adapter) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WebGPU adapter not available'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adapter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">requestDevice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    requiredFeatures: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    requiredLimits: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      maxBindGroups: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> canvas.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'webgpu'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">context) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WebGPU context not available'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> format</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.gpu.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getPreferredCanvasFormat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">configure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    device,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    format,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    alphaMode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'premultiplied'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { adapter, device, context, format };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[navigator.gpu] --&gt; B[GPUAdapter]&#10;    B --&gt; C[GPUDevice]&#10;    C --&gt; D[GPUBuffer]&#10;    C --&gt; E[GPUTexture]&#10;    C --&gt; F[GPURenderPipeline]&#10;    C --&gt; G[GPUComputePipeline]&#10;    C --&gt; H[GPUCommandEncoder]&#10;    H --&gt; I[GPUCommandBuffer]&#10;    I --&gt; J[GPUQueue]&#10;    J --&gt; K[GPU 执行]\">graph LR\n    A[navigator.gpu] --&gt; B[GPUAdapter]\n    B --&gt; C[GPUDevice]\n    C --&gt; D[GPUBuffer]\n    C --&gt; E[GPUTexture]\n    C --&gt; F[GPURenderPipeline]\n    C --&gt; G[GPUComputePipeline]\n    C --&gt; H[GPUCommandEncoder]\n    H --&gt; I[GPUCommandBuffer]\n    I --&gt; J[GPUQueue]\n    J --&gt; K[GPU 执行]</pre><p>WebGPU 对象模型的关键层级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GPUAdapter</td>\n<td>代表物理 GPU</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPUDevice</td>\n<td>GPU 操作的逻辑接口</td>\n<td>应用级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPUBuffer</td>\n<td>GPU 内存中的数据缓冲</td>\n<td>按需创建/销毁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPUTexture</td>\n<td>纹理数据</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPURenderPipeline</td>\n<td>渲染管线状态</td>\n<td>通常预创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPUCommandEncoder</td>\n<td>录制 GPU 命令</td>\n<td>每帧创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPUQueue</td>\n<td>提交命令到 GPU</td>\n<td>Device 内置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"wgsl-着色器语言\">WGSL 着色器语言</h2><p>WGSL（WebGPU Shading Language）是 WebGPU 的专用着色器语言，替代了 WebGL 中的 GLSL。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const triangleShader = `&#10;struct VertexInput {&#10;  @location(0) position: vec2&lt;f32&gt;,&#10;  @location(1) color: vec3&lt;f32&gt;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;struct VertexOutput {&#10;  @builtin(position) position: vec4&lt;f32&gt;,&#10;  @location(0) color: vec3&lt;f32&gt;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;@vertex&#10;fn vs_main(input: VertexInput) -&gt; VertexOutput {&#10;  var output: VertexOutput;&#10;  output.position = vec4&lt;f32&gt;(input.position, 0.0, 1.0);&#10;  output.color = input.color;&#10;  return output;&#10;}&#10;&#10;@fragment&#10;fn fs_main(input: VertexOutput) -&gt; @location(0) vec4&lt;f32&gt; {&#10;  return vec4&lt;f32&gt;(input.color, 1.0);&#10;}&#10;`;&#10;&#10;const createShaderModule = (device: GPUDevice, code: string): GPUShaderModule =&gt; {&#10;  return device.createShaderModule({ code });&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> triangleShader</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">struct VertexInput {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  @location(0) position: vec2&#x3C;f32>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  @location(1) color: vec3&#x3C;f32>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">struct VertexOutput {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  @builtin(position) position: vec4&#x3C;f32>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  @location(0) color: vec3&#x3C;f32>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">@vertex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fn vs_main(input: VertexInput) -> VertexOutput {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  var output: VertexOutput;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  output.position = vec4&#x3C;f32>(input.position, 0.0, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  output.color = input.color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  return output;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">@fragment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fn fs_main(input: VertexOutput) -> @location(0) vec4&#x3C;f32> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  return vec4&#x3C;f32>(input.color, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createShaderModule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUDevice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUShaderModule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createShaderModule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ code });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>WGSL 特性</th>\n<th>GLSL 对应</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@vertex / @fragment</code></td>\n<td>void main()</td>\n<td>入口点标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@location(N)</code></td>\n<td>layout(location=N)</td>\n<td>属性位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@builtin(position)</code></td>\n<td>gl_Position</td>\n<td>内置变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@group(N) @binding(M)</code></td>\n<td>layout(set=N, binding=M)</td>\n<td>资源绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vec4&lt;f32&gt;</code></td>\n<td>vec4</td>\n<td>类型参数化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>struct</code></td>\n<td>struct</td>\n<td>结构体定义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"渲染管线构建\">渲染管线构建</h2><p>WebGPU 的渲染管线是不可变的预编译对象，包含了从顶点处理到像素输出的完整状态描述。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const createRenderPipeline = (&#10;  device: GPUDevice,&#10;  format: GPUTextureFormat,&#10;  shaderModule: GPUShaderModule,&#10;): GPURenderPipeline =&gt; {&#10;  return device.createRenderPipeline({&#10;    layout: &#39;auto&#39;,&#10;    vertex: {&#10;      module: shaderModule,&#10;      entryPoint: &#39;vs_main&#39;,&#10;      buffers: [&#10;        {&#10;          arrayStride: 5 * Float32Array.BYTES_PER_ELEMENT,&#10;          attributes: [&#10;            { shaderLocation: 0, offset: 0, format: &#39;float32x2&#39; },&#10;            { shaderLocation: 1, offset: 2 * Float32Array.BYTES_PER_ELEMENT, format: &#39;float32x3&#39; },&#10;          ],&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;    fragment: {&#10;      module: shaderModule,&#10;      entryPoint: &#39;fs_main&#39;,&#10;      targets: [{ format }],&#10;    },&#10;    primitive: {&#10;      topology: &#39;triangle-list&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#